Definitions
-----------
  message_delay_ms        = db_insert_time - message_creation_time (per message)
  position_in_window      = row index 0..59 within the 60-message batch
  analytic_window_wait_ms = (59 - position_in_window) * 1000
                            i.e. the deterministic floor imposed by waiting for
                            the 60th (last) message to arrive at the coordinator.
                            Same formula as architecture A so columns line up;
                            for architecture A the formula under-counts by 1 s
                            (Flink waits for the 61st message to trigger the window).
  processing_overhead_ms  = message_delay_ms - analytic_window_wait_ms
                            i.e. infrastructure overhead above the structural floor

